{"v":4,"catch":"在 Puzzletronics 中形成邏輯電路：數字無限","desc":"Puzzletronics: Digital Infinite 是一款極簡主義的拼圖遊戲。 玩家必須移動棋子以形成邏輯電路，同時聆聽輕鬆而平靜的配樂。\n\n通過 135 個不同難度的關卡挑戰自己，學習邏輯門和數字邏輯的行為。 該遊戲呈現了一種直觀的遊戲玩法，可分發教程。\n\n特徵：\n- 超過 130 個不同級別的隨機碎片處理；\n- 極簡主義的環境；\n- 平靜輕鬆的配樂；\n- 種類繁多的作品。\n\n由 Naoka Games 開發","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2022-07-28","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","策略","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cb039ac1fe6fdb2fef733f62173a2bac8b15a783fcd14d93f7de221ebdc68e29.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/688c5d9b3b5bc5fa86efa6d25924a6a8aa643c06a0fc6b80328fbc100973718e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f94a60499569793aeea2de77f1bdc6f96341706e2234ca4349c97e676d27cd12.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14aa8d217cf80644b7fb87111fd5a00f6ebb0d64d81bbc77ccfa58ce9423c906.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d925e30e29d6e9414bdaa2a744c323e1d8355c73a6b62976094bb047711f160.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b7271a67c393fb3152b74ecc0fc1d52006ae8ca5f99a405e2e9cabb2fbd623e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100eae01814e000","dlc":[]}